---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<Page title="Privacy Policy" description={'How ' + SITE_TITLE + ' collects, uses and protects information.'}>
	<p><em>Last updated: November 24, 2026</em></p>
	<p>
		This Privacy Policy explains what information {SITE_TITLE} ("we", "us") collects when you
		visit this website, how we use it, and the choices you have.
	</p>

	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and
			the contents of your message.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Usage data.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider and analytics tools
			collect technical data such as your IP address, browser type, device, pages visited and
			the time of your visit.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Cookies.</strong> We and our partners use cookies and similar technologies, as
			described below.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>We do not require you to create an account, and we do not sell your personal information.</p>

	<h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
	<p>
		We use Google AdSense to show ads on this website. Third-party vendors, including Google, use
		cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites.
	</p>
	<p>
		Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on
		your visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.
	</p>
	<p>
		You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
		<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.
		You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising
		at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">www.aboutads.info</a>.
	</p>
	<p>
		To learn more, see
		<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Analytics</h2>
	<p>
		We may use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site. Google Analytics uses
		cookies to collect usage data in aggregated form. You can install the
		<a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>How we use information</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>To operate, maintain and improve the website</li>
		<li>To reply to messages you send us</li>
		<li>To show ads that help keep the website free</li>
		<li>To detect and prevent abuse and security problems</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
	<p>
		You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Depending on where you live (for
		example the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or California), you may have the right
		to access, correct or delete personal information we hold about you. To make a request, email
		us at <a href={'mailto:' + CONTACT_EMAIL}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Children's privacy</h2>
	<p>
		This website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
		information from them.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
	<p>
		We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it
		was last changed.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about this policy? Email <a href={'mailto:' + CONTACT_EMAIL}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</Page>
